1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,660
[Prof. Peter Kim] Slide 30 brings us to "The Digital Mandate." As we build these powerful tools, what moral principles guide us?

2
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:20,940
[TA Sarah Jenkins] First is Technological Sovereignty. You should own your own data, your own models, and your own private keys. Never surrender complete control to a single centralized monopoly.

3
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:32,880
[Prof. Peter Kim] Second is Architectural Integrity. Your systems must have transparent logs. An avatar must never lie, fabricate data, or conceal errors.

4
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:42,620
[TA Sarah Jenkins] And third is Service. The ultimate test of any technology is: Does it bring peace, focus, and blessing to your family and your community?

5
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:49,310
[Prof. Peter Kim] If an AI creates chaos and anxiety, it has failed, no matter how fast it runs.

